                                                "sense_id": "3c7dfb64-66b4-3d73-b326-9c5a0d6e9451",
                                                "text": "His answer to the sum was erroneous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb0e8188-14a8-45b6-889b-7f9a663c6625",
                                                "sense_id": "3c7dfb64-66b4-3d73-b326-9c5a0d6e9451",
                                                "text": "An erroneous early Fox News report about the New Orleans terror attack is warping the political dialogue in the aftermath of the deadly rampage."
