                                                "sense_id": "13e771a7-8c6e-33d0-b13c-7913b53503ec",
                                                "text": "His conclusion was erroneous, since it was based on a false assumption."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dffdb367-f7cf-3ec3-af73-c4b4affb6872",
