                                                "sense_id": "dffdb367-f7cf-3ec3-af73-c4b4affb6872",
                                                "text": "Her choice at the line-up proved to be erroneous, as she had only seen the mugger for an instant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "68e2fef3-4cfa-3aa2-b151-4f8b95e26fb6",
                                        "entry_id": "fda0912a-0545-3a0a-b4fb-deb5c04d5380",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Wandering; erratic."
